{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、夢ですごく綺麗な山の景色を\n見ました( 〃 ˆᴗˆ 〃 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを、少し高い所から\n動画撮ってる自分がいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはどこだろう？\n見たことあるようでなかったなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々、そんな夢を見ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはそんな感じの壮大な夢見るー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー久々にどっか行きたい(  ˊ࿁ˋ ) 〇゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ 本日、11月17 日（木）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Rの法則」NHKにて、\n18時55分～19時25分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ベストヒット歌謡祭」\n日本テレビにて、19時～21時\n大阪から生放送です～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもぜひ見てくださいな♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ 乃木坂46の 「の」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送にて、11月20日(日)\n18:00～18:30放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりラジオは楽しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、身になる話はひとつもないです笑\n30分間ただただ笑うだけの時間。\nそういう時間が一番すき(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は取材dayでした **\n最近５つくらいお話をさせて頂く\n機会がありまして、有難いです(•ᵕᴗᵕ•)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と同時に、取材内容も\"1年を振り返って\"\nとかになってきて、もうそんな季節なのかあ\nってびっくりしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の色んなことを思い返して\n改めて、沢山の方に感謝しないとって\nあったかい気持ちになったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売お楽しみに～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の「うたコン」も\n有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お着物着させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和っていいよね(๑`･ᴗ･´๑)うむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、和食の良さもよりわかるように\nなってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔よりも健康に気を使って食材も\n選ぶようになった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和食って、無形文化遺産なんですね。\n街を歩くと、和食器が目にとまる。\n繊細で素朴であったかい。\n和食うまく作れるようになりたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に炊飯器ほしい。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然のオフショット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/11/17/6888133/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんにね、\n「リーくんとねこ丸は元気？」\n( 実家で飼ってる犬と猫 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って送ったら、「元気だよ！」って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、お母さんが言うには、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今はねこ丸のほうが\n大きくなっちゃって、\nなぎごえもニャーじゃない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガァオーガァオー！\nヴァオーって鳴くよ！」と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな猫いるのか( ´⚰︎` )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとなぎごえって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帝一の國の映画版\nキャストが発表されましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しみ(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)\n絶対観にいこーっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ"}],"source":"archive"}